          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اندھیرا (andherā) is inherited from Sanskrit andhakāra, \"darkness\" (CDIAL 386), where CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin ãdherā."
            }
          ]
        },
